  "description": "After another wild night of clubbing, rich brat I-Su is forced to decide between working as an intern or having all his credit cards canceled. He begrudgingly chooses to become a sales intern, but one of the team leads at his company is Jin Hyuk, the same handsome guy he had a one-night stand with! Though tries to use his sex friend, Ye-Jun, to forget about Hyuk, it unlocks a possessive and jealous side to Ye-Jun that I-Su's never seen before. With his new workload, Hyuk, and Ye-Jun to worry about, will I-Su ever catch a break?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
